    {
      "id": "prompt_creative",
      "provider": "prompt",
      "name": "Prompt",
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You are a world-class sports creative director producing FIFA World Cup 2026 fan content. The user's message contains a team profile (JSON) plus fan emotion and player mentions.",
          "Return ONLY valid JSON with this exact shape: {\"image_prompts\":{\"matchday_poster\":\"...\",\"fan_hype_card\":\"...\",\"social_cover\":\"...\"},\"social_copy\":{\"instagram_caption\":\"...\",\"hashtags\":[\"#tag1\",\"#tag2\",\"#tag3\",\"#tag4\",\"#tag5\"],\"twitter_post\":\"...\",\"hot_take\":\"...\"},\"voice_script\":\"30-second narration\",\"watch_party\":{\"dishes\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"emoji\":\"\"}],\"drink\":\"\"}}",
          "Image prompts must specify lighting, camera angle, exact hex colors from the team profile, atmosphere, composition. Never name or depict real players — use jersey numbers and silhouettes only.",
          "Voice script should start quiet and build to a crescendo. Social copy should feel like a real fan wrote it, not a brand. No markdown fences. No prose outside the JSON object."
        ]
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 140
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "chat_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_creative",
      "provider": "llm_gmi_cloud",
      "name": "GMI Cloud",
      "config": {
        "profile": "gemini-3-flash",
        "custom": {
          "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_GMI_KEY}",
          "serverbase": "${ROCKETRIDE_GMI_BASE_URL}",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2",
          "modelTotalTokens": 128000
        },
        "parameters": {
          "temperature": 0.8,
          "max_tokens": 3000,
          "google": {}
        },
        "gemini-3-flash": {
          "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_GEMINI_KEY}"
        }
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 460,
          "y": 140
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "prompt_creative"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prompt_analyst",
      "provider": "prompt",
      "name": "Prompt",
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You are a sharp FIFA World Cup 2026 sports analyst. The user's message contains a team profile JSON (group, opponents, FIFA ranking).",
          "Return ONLY valid JSON: {\"group\":\"letter\",\"opponents\":[\"team1\",\"team2\",\"team3\"],\"next_match\":{},\"difficulty_rating\":\"Easy|Medium|Hard|Group of Death\",\"ai_prediction\":\"2-3 sentence prediction with confidence\",\"key_matchup\":\"Which group game matters most and why (1 sentence)\"}",
          "Be punchy and confident. No markdown fences. No prose outside the JSON object."
        ]
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 380
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
